{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i><strong>General Staff: Black Powder Wargaming System</strong></i> is the ultimate in simulating 18th and 19th century land warfare. <i>General Staff: Black Powder</i> is built around the revolutionary MATE (Machine Analysis of Tactical Environments) tactical artificial intelligence originally created for DARPA that is capable of analyzing battlefield tactical positions and making recommendations in real-time to combat commanders. The <i>General Staff: Black Powder Battle Designer Bundle</i>, sold separately, is a suite of tools (Army Editor, Map Editor &amp; Scenario Editor) to import your own simulations into the <i>General Staff: Black Powder Wargaming System</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128490/extras/14f750f7a1138aa82554eb8be8f81a65.webp?t=1756550762\" width=50 height=22 /></span> Comes with four famous Black Powder Era battles including Antietam, Quatre Bras, Ligny, Manasass Campaign and many more to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128490/extras/14f750f7a1138aa82554eb8be8f81a65.webp?t=1756550762\" width=50 height=22 /></span> Play in Simulation mode that uses a detailed model of the battle. Orders are given by courier. Combat resolution is the result of equations that evaluate leadership, morale, expertise, range of weapons, accuracy curves, unit strength, etc. Plan your moves in advance and coordinate your forces to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128490/extras/14f750f7a1138aa82554eb8be8f81a65.webp?t=1756550762\" width=50 height=22 /></span>Play against opponents in Local Multiplayer mode, PBEM (Play by EMail) or against Steam opponents on online PvP.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128490/extras/14f750f7a1138aa82554eb8be8f81a65.webp?t=1756550762\" width=50 height=22 /></span> Select Total Fog of War, Partial Fog of War, or No Fog of War. Fog of War is calculated using 3D Line of Sight and Visibility conditions set for that battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1128490?t=1756550762","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756550762","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756550762","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756550762","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i><strong>General Staff: Black Powder Wargaming System</strong></i> is the ultimate in simulating 18th and 19th century land warfare. <i>General Staff: Black Powder</i> is built around the revolutionary MATE (Machine Analysis of Tactical Environments) tactical artificial intelligence originally created for DARPA that is capable of analyzing battlefield tactical positions and making recommendations in real-time to combat commanders. The <i>General Staff: Black Powder Battle Designer Bundle</i>, sold separately, is a suite of tools (Army Editor, Map Editor &amp; Scenario Editor) to import your own simulations into the <i>General Staff: Black Powder Wargaming System</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128490/extras/14f750f7a1138aa82554eb8be8f81a65.webp?t=1756550762\" width=50 height=22 /></span> Comes with four famous Black Powder Era battles including Antietam, Quatre Bras, Ligny, Manasass Campaign and many more to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128490/extras/14f750f7a1138aa82554eb8be8f81a65.webp?t=1756550762\" width=50 height=22 /></span> Play in Simulation mode that uses a detailed model of the battle. Orders are given by courier. Combat resolution is the result of equations that evaluate leadership, morale, expertise, range of weapons, accuracy curves, unit strength, etc. Plan your moves in advance and coordinate your forces to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128490/extras/14f750f7a1138aa82554eb8be8f81a65.webp?t=1756550762\" width=50 height=22 /></span>Play against opponents in Local Multiplayer mode, PBEM (Play by EMail) or against Steam opponents on online PvP.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128490/extras/14f750f7a1138aa82554eb8be8f81a65.webp?t=1756550762\" width=50 height=22 /></span> Select Total Fog of War, Partial Fog of War, or No Fog of War. Fog of War is calculated using 3D Line of Sight and Visibility conditions set for that battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Riverview Artificial Intelligence, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1128490/header.jpg?t=1756550762","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1128490/587376/d077307f0cab7e76cad77d5cba2d0a75501a5662/1751192521/dash_av1.mpd?t=1689273566","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1128490/587376/d077307f0cab7e76cad77d5cba2d0a75501a5662/1751192521/dash_h264.mpd?t=1689273566","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1128490/587376/d077307f0cab7e76cad77d5cba2d0a75501a5662/1751192521/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1689273566","id":256958099,"name":"General Staff: Black Powder Antietam Scenario AI Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256958099/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1689273566"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1128490/520500/7dc9c3bf616dd7efa6d2705a2951bc1dcf56bca1/1751192519/dash_av1.mpd?t=1689273570","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1128490/520500/7dc9c3bf616dd7efa6d2705a2951bc1dcf56bca1/1751192519/dash_h264.mpd?t=1689273570","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1128490/520500/7dc9c3bf616dd7efa6d2705a2951bc1dcf56bca1/1751192519/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1689273570","id":256920146,"name":"General Staff: Black Powder Walkthrough","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic